# MiniGPT

A GPT-style Large Language Model built from scratch using PyTorch.

## 🎯 Goal

The goal of this project is to understand how Large Language Models work internally by implementing the major components of a GPT-style Transformer.

## 🧠 Concepts

- Tokenization
- Token embeddings
- Positional embeddings
- Self-attention
- Causal attention
- Multi-head attention
- Feed-forward networks
- Layer normalization
- Residual connections
- Transformer blocks
- GPT architecture
- Language model training
- Text generation
- Sampling
- Fine-tuning
- Perplexity

## 🏗️ Architecture

```text
Text
 ↓
Tokenizer
 ↓
Token IDs
 ↓
Embeddings
 ↓
Transformer
 ↓
GPT
 ↓
Next Token Prediction
 ↓
Generated Text